## Input

```css
@use "sass:list";
@use "sass:map";

$gap: 8px;
$offsets: [-$gap, +$gap];
$flags: [not false, 1 < 2];
$config: (offsets: $offsets);

.case-user-seed {
  left: list.nth($offsets, 1);
  right: list.nth($offsets, 2);
  enabled: list.nth($flags, 1);
  comparison: list.nth($flags, 2);
  bracketed: list.is-bracketed($offsets);
  items: list.length($flags);
  from-map: list.nth(map.get($config, offsets), 1);
}

```


